WEBVTT

00:14.180 --> 00:17.260
<b><i>He is Ranma of the Saotome School</i>
<i>of Anything Goes Martial Arts.</i></b>

00:18.600 --> 00:21.020
<b><i>She is Akane of the Tendo Dojo.</i></b>

00:22.020 --> 00:25.190
<b><i>The two of them are now engaged</i>
<i>due to their parents' decision.</i></b>

00:25.270 --> 00:26.770
<b>Don't decide who I'll marry.</b>

00:26.860 --> 00:28.020
<b>It's irritating.</b>

00:28.650 --> 00:31.280
<b><i>And Ranma has a problem.</i></b>

00:34.570 --> 00:35.700
<b>What the hell are you doing?</b>

00:36.280 --> 00:39.450
<b><i>He transforms into a girl</i>
<i>when he's splashed with water.</i></b>

00:46.290 --> 00:50.550
<b>RANMA1/2</b>

02:12.040 --> 02:14.460
<b>KOLKHOZ HIGH SCHOOL</b>

02:14.550 --> 02:17.590
<b>-Charlotte Cup?
-What's this about?</b>

02:17.840 --> 02:19.220
<b>I'LL NEVER LET GO</b>

02:19.300 --> 02:22.180
<b>-Mikado's competing.
-I've got to go cheer him on.</b>

02:23.100 --> 02:24.760
<b>What's this Charlotte Cup?</b>

02:25.270 --> 02:26.520
<b>What a joke.</b>

02:27.600 --> 02:31.770
<b><i>I have to somehow pair up</i>
<i>with Akane in today's match</i></b>

02:32.270 --> 02:33.270
<b><i>and win!</i></b>

02:35.980 --> 02:38.570
<b>There you are, "Charlotte."</b>

02:41.160 --> 02:43.910
<b>Together, Akane and I are unbeatable.</b>

02:44.580 --> 02:46.950
<b>You just sit back and enjoy the show.</b>

02:50.670 --> 02:53.630
<b>MARTIAL SKATING
BOYS' DRESSING ROOM</b>

03:04.180 --> 03:05.510
<b>I'm flawless, as always.</b>

03:08.600 --> 03:10.560
<b>Yo, chronic horndog.</b>

03:11.770 --> 03:13.230
<b>That's Mikado Sanzenin to you!</b>

03:14.310 --> 03:16.440
<b>Are your wounds all better?</b>

03:17.150 --> 03:19.780
<b>I admit, I underestimated you
the other day.</b>

03:20.490 --> 03:23.360
<b>But today is an official match.
It's different.</b>

03:25.370 --> 03:29.450
<b>Your skating partner… Akane Tendo, was it?</b>

03:32.170 --> 03:34.920
<b>I haven't given her a proper greeting yet.</b>

03:35.000 --> 03:36.210
<b>Greeting?</b>

03:38.590 --> 03:40.050
<b>I declare.</b>

03:40.630 --> 03:42.510
<b>During today's match, I will</b>

03:43.300 --> 03:47.100
<b>steal Akane Tendo's lips,
no matter what it takes!</b>

03:47.180 --> 03:48.810
<b>What the hell?</b>

03:50.230 --> 03:53.940
<b>You philanderer, do you only think about
those kinds of things?</b>

03:54.520 --> 03:58.070
<b>My head is full of those sorts of things!</b>

03:59.900 --> 04:01.570
<b><i>What a formidable guy.</i></b>

04:04.110 --> 04:05.820
<b>Someone's talking about me.</b>

04:09.120 --> 04:11.160
<b>Anxiety and excitement abound</b>

04:11.250 --> 04:13.620
<b>inside the Kolkhoz High School
skating rink.</b>

04:13.710 --> 04:17.500
<b>Many students have gathered to witness</b>

04:17.590 --> 04:20.260
<b>the apocalypse
that's about to unfold today.</b>

04:20.340 --> 04:23.680
<b>The fated match between Kolkhoz
High School and Furinkan High School</b>

04:23.760 --> 04:26.760
<b>for the Charlotte Cup will begin shortly.</b>

04:26.840 --> 04:28.550
<b>This is the battle on ice.</b>

04:28.640 --> 04:30.850
<b>In 1242, Alexander Nevsky led his army</b>

04:30.930 --> 04:35.940
<b>and defeated the Livonian army
on the frozen lake.</b>

04:36.020 --> 04:37.310
<b>Will it be Furinkan or Kolkhoz</b>

04:37.400 --> 04:41.230
<b>who will seize the victory
to become the Alexander Nevsky of our day?</b>

04:41.320 --> 04:43.650
<b>As always, the commentary
is brought to you by yours truly,</b>

04:43.740 --> 04:45.950
<b>Ichiro of the Furinkan Broadcast Club.</b>

04:51.540 --> 04:55.120
<b>The stadium is briefly engulfed
by the dark as both teams enter the rink.</b>

04:58.540 --> 05:00.840
<b>First up is
the golden pair of Martial Skating.</b>

05:00.920 --> 05:04.010
<b>Azusa Shiratori and Mikado Sanzenin
make their grand entrance!</b>

05:12.680 --> 05:14.980
<b>Mikado, my darling!</b>

05:15.560 --> 05:19.610
<b>Azusa!</b>

05:19.690 --> 05:22.190
<b>Talk about a showy entrance.</b>

05:22.690 --> 05:23.610
<b>Tell me 'bout it.</b>

05:25.360 --> 05:27.780
<b>Try to stay away from Mikado, okay?</b>

05:28.700 --> 05:30.070
<b>What are you saying?</b>

05:30.620 --> 05:32.870
<b>I can't attack unless I get near him.</b>

05:33.660 --> 05:35.120
<b>I know, but still…</b>

05:35.710 --> 05:37.580
<b>All right, it's our time to shine.</b>

05:39.380 --> 05:41.710
<b>All right, we'll give 'em
a show of our own!</b>

05:43.550 --> 05:46.050
<b>Let's go blow their minds!</b>

05:46.130 --> 05:47.340
<b>Ranma!</b>

05:51.470 --> 05:52.970
<b>What's this?</b>

05:53.060 --> 05:56.850
<b>Akane Tendo and Ranma Saotome
also make their mind-blowing entrance!</b>

05:57.810 --> 06:00.230
<b>Stop, please! No more!</b>

06:08.490 --> 06:09.950
<b>Enough already!</b>

06:12.370 --> 06:16.080
<b>This seals the deal.
Charlotte will be mine.</b>

06:18.620 --> 06:22.130
<b>I won't give you P-chan. Never!</b>

06:25.460 --> 06:26.460
<b>The match begins.</b>

06:27.050 --> 06:29.010
<b>It's the battle to claim the pet piggy.</b>

06:29.090 --> 06:33.010
<b>It's an all-or-nothing knockout,
infinite duration, winner-takes-all match.</b>

06:34.180 --> 06:37.060
<b>-Preemptive strike, let's go!
-Yeah.</b>

06:37.140 --> 06:38.730
<b>Both pairs are off to smooth skating.</b>

06:39.230 --> 06:41.940
<b>The Furinkan pair launches
a death spiral, then a piercing kick!</b>

06:43.110 --> 06:44.320
<b>What?</b>

06:44.400 --> 06:46.030
<b>You're absolutely gorgeous today.</b>

06:48.490 --> 06:52.910
<b>Watch out! Is Mikado kicking off
with his special move, the Kiss Attack?</b>

06:55.580 --> 06:57.370
<b>Not on my watch!</b>

06:58.250 --> 06:59.500
<b>Ranma, above you!</b>

07:00.330 --> 07:03.420
<b>Watch out! A diving knee drop!
It's a direct hit!</b>

07:03.500 --> 07:04.630
<b>Ranma!</b>

07:05.290 --> 07:06.880
<b>No one can stop us now.</b>

07:12.590 --> 07:16.220
<b>She rejected my kiss. What a shy girl.</b>

07:16.720 --> 07:18.600
<b>She's absolutely repulsed by you.</b>

07:19.430 --> 07:21.690
<b>Get it together. Hey.</b>

07:23.350 --> 07:26.690
<b>The more she pushes me away,
the more it fuels my fire.</b>

07:28.860 --> 07:30.820
<b>I'll steal your lips, you'll see!</b>

07:38.450 --> 07:40.370
<b>Get out of the way, Akane.</b>

07:41.910 --> 07:43.420
<b>Furinkan pair's throw jump.</b>

07:48.670 --> 07:50.760
<b>It's a fake. He went straight for a punch!</b>

07:55.470 --> 07:57.760
<b>Fence!</b>

07:57.850 --> 07:58.930
<b>I can see that!</b>

07:59.020 --> 08:00.270
<b>Stop!</b>

08:00.350 --> 08:02.140
<b>I can't!</b>

08:02.230 --> 08:04.150
<b>A perfectly-executed backflip!</b>

08:11.690 --> 08:13.400
<b>San-chan, does it hurt right here?</b>

08:13.950 --> 08:15.160
<b>Or is it here?</b>

08:16.120 --> 08:19.450
<b>-Does it hurt? Does it?
-Stop punching</b>

08:19.540 --> 08:22.710
<b>right where it hurts, stupid girl!</b>

08:22.790 --> 08:25.290
<b>Hey, I'm just worried about you.</b>

08:29.420 --> 08:33.050
<b>How dare you bring me,
Mikado Sanzenin, down on my knee.</b>

08:33.670 --> 08:38.720
<b>Try to pull something on Akane again, and
next time, it's gonna be more than a knee.</b>

08:39.390 --> 08:41.850
<b>Really now? What will you do?</b>

08:41.930 --> 08:43.600
<b>I'll throw you into a casket.</b>

08:44.690 --> 08:47.310
<b>Akane is my fiancée, you hear me?</b>

08:47.860 --> 08:49.610
<b>Mess with her, and you're dead!</b>

08:54.030 --> 08:55.780
<b><i>Did he really mean it?</i></b>

08:57.620 --> 08:59.120
<b>Fiancée, huh?</b>

08:59.620 --> 09:01.160
<b>What a fragile bond.</b>

09:01.740 --> 09:05.750
<b>I'll do everything I can
to end your relationship.</b>

09:05.830 --> 09:10.590
<b>We, the golden pair of Martial Skating,
are also called…</b>

09:14.630 --> 09:16.930
<b>The Matchbreaker on Ice!</b>

09:17.510 --> 09:18.510
<b>That's right.</b>

09:19.140 --> 09:22.970
<b>The pair Mikado Sanzenin
and Azusa Shiratori's ultimate technique</b>

09:23.470 --> 09:25.270
<b>is the Couple Crusher!</b>

09:26.270 --> 09:28.520
<b>Not once have we failed…</b>

09:29.020 --> 09:31.820
<b>…to break a couple apart!</b>

09:31.900 --> 09:34.030
<b>Quit yapping. Let's go!</b>

09:34.110 --> 09:35.030
<b>Okay.</b>

09:37.490 --> 09:39.030
<b><i>Focus, focus.</i></b>

09:46.960 --> 09:49.330
<b>What are you doing to him?</b>

09:49.960 --> 09:51.170
<b>I caught you off guard.</b>

10:10.690 --> 10:12.520
<b>There it is!</b>

10:12.610 --> 10:15.110
<b>This is the feared Couple Crusher,</b>

10:15.190 --> 10:18.110
<b>The Good-Bye Whirl!</b>

10:22.870 --> 10:26.250
<b>Let go of her hands,
and I'll stop spinning.</b>

10:26.330 --> 10:28.330
<b>What? That's ridiculous!</b>

10:28.410 --> 10:30.420
<b>Let me go, Ranma.</b>

10:30.500 --> 10:33.000
<b>Idiot, you'll slam into the ice.</b>

10:35.670 --> 10:38.840
<b>Betray your partner and let go.
It's the only way to save yourself.</b>

10:39.340 --> 10:40.930
<b>I'm fine. Just let go!</b>

10:41.010 --> 10:43.140
<b>How can I, after what he said?</b>

10:44.430 --> 10:48.980
<b>The deeper the trust in each other,
the bigger the shock when you're let go.</b>

10:49.560 --> 10:51.900
<b>Every pair that is put through
The Good-Bye Whirl</b>

10:51.980 --> 10:54.440
<b>inevitably has a fall out!</b>

10:55.820 --> 10:57.530
<b>Don't believe a word he says.</b>

10:57.610 --> 10:59.740
<b>I'm telling you, I'll be fine.
Just let me go.</b>

11:00.740 --> 11:01.950
<b>No, stupid!</b>

11:02.030 --> 11:05.950
<b>I can't leave a slowpoke like you
to fend for yourself!</b>

11:06.040 --> 11:08.450
<b>Hey, what did you just say?</b>

11:09.500 --> 11:11.420
<b>I'm getting tired.</b>

11:11.500 --> 11:13.080
<b>I can't keep this up!</b>

11:38.030 --> 11:39.070
<b>He…</b>

11:39.780 --> 11:42.150
<b>He endured the whole attack
without letting go!</b>

11:42.240 --> 11:44.740
<b>The Good-Bye Whirl was defeated!</b>

11:45.660 --> 11:47.410
<b>But he must be seriously injured.</b>

11:47.490 --> 11:49.200
<b>Can Ranma Saotome get back on his feet?</b>

11:50.370 --> 11:51.910
<b>Dummy! Show-off!</b>

11:52.420 --> 11:54.130
<b>You didn't have to go this far.</b>

11:57.090 --> 11:58.090
<b>Ranma?</b>

11:59.800 --> 12:01.170
<b>Hey, Ranma.</b>

12:02.430 --> 12:05.430
<b>Every bone in his body must be fractured.</b>

12:05.930 --> 12:07.810
<b>Only a monster would survive.</b>

12:10.020 --> 12:11.480
<b><i>He did it for me…</i></b>

12:14.310 --> 12:17.020
<b>Ranma, you idiot!</b>

12:19.730 --> 12:21.110
<b>Hey, you.</b>

12:21.190 --> 12:23.990
<b>How about a "thank you" or even "sorry"?</b>

12:28.330 --> 12:29.910
<b>You tricked me.</b>

12:29.990 --> 12:31.500
<b>Who are you calling an idiot?</b>

12:32.000 --> 12:34.460
<b>I was worried. What's wrong with you?</b>

12:35.330 --> 12:37.880
<b>I'd never be taken down
by a measly attack like that.</b>

12:40.670 --> 12:43.090
<b>It stings…</b>

12:44.430 --> 12:45.470
<b>He stood back up.</b>

12:45.550 --> 12:48.140
<b>The battle's just getting started.</b>

12:48.680 --> 12:52.640
<b>The match resumes. The Charlotte Cup
to claim ownership over the pet pig.</b>

12:52.730 --> 12:54.440
<b>Who will be crowned the winner?</b>

12:54.520 --> 12:55.850
<b>The piggy's gone.</b>

12:55.940 --> 12:57.100
<b>What?</b>

12:58.360 --> 12:59.690
<b>Charlotte?</b>

13:04.820 --> 13:06.530
<b><i>At last, my moment has come.</i></b>

13:09.030 --> 13:11.990
<b>Like always, you are tough as nails.</b>

13:12.700 --> 13:13.910
<b>You bet I am.</b>

13:14.000 --> 13:16.170
<b>We're just warming up, Mikado.</b>

13:16.250 --> 13:19.130
<b>Wait. You can't continue to fight
with a body like that.</b>

13:19.210 --> 13:22.800
<b>Don't butt in.
I'm gonna beat that lecher to a pulp.</b>

13:22.880 --> 13:25.880
<b>As for me,
I can't have you forfeit just yet.</b>

13:26.590 --> 13:30.930
<b>Not until I steal Akane Tendo's lips
like I declared, that is!</b>

13:32.470 --> 13:34.560
<b>Charlotte is missing!</b>

13:34.640 --> 13:36.890
<b>What was that for, stupid girl?</b>

13:36.980 --> 13:38.560
<b>Go find my Charlotte!</b>

13:39.190 --> 13:40.400
<b>Let's get 'em, Akane.</b>

13:40.480 --> 13:42.230
<b>Hey, I said wait.</b>

13:46.650 --> 13:48.740
<b>Yo, what the hell was that for?</b>

13:48.820 --> 13:50.030
<b>Don't overdo it.</b>

13:55.660 --> 13:56.870
<b>Please.</b>

14:04.130 --> 14:04.960
<b>What?</b>

14:05.050 --> 14:06.260
<b>A blackout?</b>

14:06.340 --> 14:08.380
<b>Someone cut the power!</b>

14:12.140 --> 14:14.310
<b>Go spectate
the rest of the match as a girl.</b>

14:16.060 --> 14:18.020
<b>Come on, Akane, pair up with me.</b>

14:19.560 --> 14:22.270
<b><i>You bastard, we were having a moment.</i></b>

14:23.270 --> 14:24.690
<b>What happened?</b>

14:25.280 --> 14:30.110
<b>Now what is this? The Furinkan High
skaters have swapped out!</b>

14:30.700 --> 14:32.700
<b>Why are you on the rink?</b>

14:33.240 --> 14:35.490
<b>You dragged me out here, idiot!</b>

14:35.580 --> 14:37.120
<b>-You!
-Take this!</b>

14:37.830 --> 14:40.040
<b>That pigtailed girl…</b>

14:44.590 --> 14:47.010
<b><i>She's the one that</i>
<i>gracefully accepted my kiss.</i></b>

14:48.260 --> 14:51.550
<b>Wow, Mikado was my very first kiss.</b>

14:52.890 --> 14:54.350
<b>I'm so happy!</b>

14:54.430 --> 14:55.850
<b>Wait, you…</b>

15:00.100 --> 15:01.520
<b>Stop blabbering nonsense.</b>

15:01.600 --> 15:03.730
<b>I'm so happy to see you again.</b>

15:03.810 --> 15:04.940
<b>Right, right.</b>

15:07.610 --> 15:09.400
<b>Let's pick up where we left off, yeah?</b>

15:09.900 --> 15:11.740
<b>-Hold it.
-Why did you hit me?</b>

15:12.820 --> 15:13.910
<b>Say, Ranma.</b>

15:14.620 --> 15:18.910
<b>You're battered from head to toe.</b>

15:19.410 --> 15:21.870
<b>Leave the match to me and Akane.</b>

15:21.960 --> 15:25.500
<b>You go sit and watch.</b>

15:25.590 --> 15:26.590
<b>Hey!</b>

15:26.670 --> 15:28.210
<b>This pair is unacceptable!</b>

15:28.300 --> 15:31.130
<b>The audience erupts in an uproar!</b>

15:31.220 --> 15:33.340
<b>Are they protesting the change of pairs?</b>

15:33.930 --> 15:35.890
<b>No one cares about that!</b>

15:35.970 --> 15:38.560
<b>The girl's costume
isn't sexy in the tiniest bit!</b>

15:39.220 --> 15:40.060
<b>-You suck.
-You suck.</b>

15:41.140 --> 15:43.310
<b>Leave it to us.</b>

15:44.480 --> 15:48.190
<b>What's this? Kolkhoz High School
Stylist Club jumps into the fight!</b>

15:48.280 --> 15:49.860
<b>Come on. Step inside.</b>

15:49.940 --> 15:51.610
<b>You get a makeover too.</b>

15:51.700 --> 15:53.820
<b>-Now, that's gorgeous!
-What's going on?</b>

15:53.910 --> 15:56.030
<b>No, this one suits her better.</b>

15:59.120 --> 16:02.290
<b>Now that the pair's had a makeover,
we're ready to resume the match.</b>

16:03.290 --> 16:05.670
<b>Wait a hot second.
Akane and I were going to--</b>

16:05.750 --> 16:07.340
<b>Get over it.</b>

16:07.420 --> 16:10.840
<b>Besides, I hope you learned how to skate.</b>

16:11.340 --> 16:14.010
<b>You buffoon,
you think I had the time to practice?</b>

16:14.090 --> 16:15.930
<b>-What?
-Relax.</b>

16:16.010 --> 16:17.850
<b>I can at least stand and walk on the ice.</b>

16:18.640 --> 16:20.310
<b>Forgive me, Akane.</b>

16:20.390 --> 16:23.520
<b>It looks like I couldn't kiss you
during the match.</b>

16:24.020 --> 16:25.560
<b>What are you talking about?</b>

16:25.650 --> 16:28.770
<b>To make up for it, I'll take you
on a date after the match.</b>

16:36.450 --> 16:38.830
<b>Come on, Akane. Pair up with me.</b>

16:38.910 --> 16:39.910
<b>Right.</b>

16:40.830 --> 16:42.160
<b>Charlotte!</b>

16:42.910 --> 16:45.080
<b>You are Charlotte, aren't you?</b>

16:45.670 --> 16:46.670
<b>What?</b>

16:47.170 --> 16:50.500
<b>That collar was my gift to Charlotte.</b>

16:55.760 --> 16:57.340
<b>Have you lost your mind?</b>

16:57.430 --> 17:00.180
<b>-Listen, my name is--
-P-chan.</b>

17:00.760 --> 17:02.350
<b>Who you callin' P-chan?</b>

17:05.310 --> 17:08.060
<b>I knew it. You're still hurt from before.</b>

17:08.560 --> 17:09.940
<b>Stay down and rest.</b>

17:10.860 --> 17:11.690
<b>Wait up.</b>

17:13.440 --> 17:16.160
<b>I want you to stay put.</b>

17:16.240 --> 17:19.160
<b>No! You're the one who needs to rest.</b>

17:19.740 --> 17:22.240
<b>I'm tellin' you, I'll be fine.</b>

17:22.330 --> 17:24.790
<b>But you're not fine at all!</b>

17:24.870 --> 17:25.960
<b>I said I'm fine!</b>

17:28.080 --> 17:30.170
<b>Why are you so stubborn?</b>

17:30.250 --> 17:31.380
<b>Look who's talking.</b>

17:31.960 --> 17:33.590
<b>You really aren't cute.</b>

17:34.670 --> 17:36.970
<b>I'm worried about you.</b>

17:37.050 --> 17:39.010
<b>I hate you!</b>

17:39.600 --> 17:41.010
<b>Let's go, Ryoga.</b>

17:52.190 --> 17:53.570
<b>Ranma.</b>

17:54.690 --> 17:56.360
<b>Ryoga and I will take him down.</b>

17:57.030 --> 17:58.660
<b>Will that do, Ryoga?</b>

18:00.530 --> 18:01.780
<b>Guess I've got no choice.</b>

18:02.490 --> 18:04.450
<b>You heard us. We're swapping skaters.</b>

18:05.040 --> 18:06.460
<b>I don't want any complaints.</b>

18:06.540 --> 18:07.750
<b>Complaints? No way.</b>

18:08.420 --> 18:12.290
<b>You want another kiss from me that badly.</b>

18:12.380 --> 18:13.630
<b>I understand.</b>

18:16.130 --> 18:17.670
<b>I accept this challenge.</b>

18:18.840 --> 18:21.050
<b>I've no idea what he's onto,
but let's go, Ryoga.</b>

18:21.600 --> 18:22.600
<b>Let's go.</b>

18:25.060 --> 18:27.230
<b><i>His pain must be unbearable.</i></b>

18:27.730 --> 18:29.100
<b><i>Ranma, you dummy.</i></b>

18:33.520 --> 18:35.650
<b>What the hell was that?</b>

18:35.730 --> 18:38.030
<b>I told you, I can't skate!</b>

18:38.110 --> 18:39.240
<b>A one-two.</b>

18:39.740 --> 18:40.740
<b>Hup ho.</b>

18:44.160 --> 18:45.740
<b>Hey, you, let go!</b>

18:47.290 --> 18:49.500
<b>You hate to see it!</b>

18:49.580 --> 18:52.040
<b>That's another go
at the ultimate Couple Crusher,</b>

18:52.130 --> 18:54.710
<b>The Good-Bye Whirl!</b>

18:54.800 --> 18:57.210
<b>Hurry up and let go, you bastard!</b>

18:59.220 --> 19:00.930
<b>Like hell I will!</b>

19:03.100 --> 19:04.140
<b>I felt that one!</b>

19:05.970 --> 19:08.560
<b>The Good-Bye Whirl,
what a dreadful attack!</b>

19:08.640 --> 19:12.940
<b>Yet another trusting couple
has been torn apart!</b>

19:13.440 --> 19:15.270
<b>They didn't get along from the start.</b>

19:16.400 --> 19:20.240
<b>The Good-Bye Whirl's finishing blow
is just about to begin.</b>

19:25.620 --> 19:26.950
<b>Take this!</b>

19:31.000 --> 19:32.210
<b>That was a close call.</b>

19:32.710 --> 19:37.340
<b>The man you trusted betrayed you.
What a pitiful girl.</b>

19:37.840 --> 19:39.760
<b>But don't be sad.</b>

19:40.840 --> 19:43.300
<b>Starting today, I'm your boyfriend.</b>

19:43.800 --> 19:45.680
<b>Mikado, my darling!</b>

19:48.140 --> 19:49.770
<b>Stop dreaming.</b>

19:51.600 --> 19:53.690
<b>Come on, Ryoga. Get up already.</b>

19:57.070 --> 19:58.690
<b>If only this wasn't here…</b>

20:00.110 --> 20:02.450
<b>If only we weren't fighting on this rink…</b>

20:02.530 --> 20:03.530
<b>I could win!</b>

20:08.160 --> 20:09.450
<b>Icy!</b>

20:09.950 --> 20:11.540
<b>-Water?
-That's right.</b>

20:12.040 --> 20:15.420
<b>This rink was specially built
by freezing a swimming pool.</b>

20:16.460 --> 20:20.210
<b>Why didn't you tell us earlier?</b>

20:20.920 --> 20:25.840
<b>The rink is collapsing into drifting ice!</b>

20:29.350 --> 20:30.560
<b>What a fool.</b>

20:30.640 --> 20:32.810
<b>So, Ryoga, what will it be?</b>

20:32.890 --> 20:35.520
<b>I'm already in my girl body,
so this doesn't bother me.</b>

20:36.360 --> 20:40.110
<b><i>If I turn into a pig</i>
<i>in front of Akane's eyes…</i></b>

20:42.240 --> 20:44.030
<b>Ryoga, you're P-chan?</b>

20:44.110 --> 20:45.910
<b>This is awful. You've tricked me.</b>

20:45.990 --> 20:48.280
<b>No! I never meant to deceive you.</b>

20:48.370 --> 20:52.200
<b>You pretended to be a pig
so that you can sneak into my bed.</b>

20:52.700 --> 20:53.710
<b>You're the worst.</b>

20:56.000 --> 20:58.790
<b>Don't you ever come close to me again.</b>

20:58.880 --> 21:00.460
<b>You big perv!</b>

21:04.630 --> 21:07.390
<b>This isn't what I want!</b>

21:07.470 --> 21:08.640
<b>Shut up!</b>

21:08.720 --> 21:10.260
<b>We've no choice but to do this.</b>

21:10.350 --> 21:12.310
<b>Show 'em what you've got, for Akane!</b>

21:17.690 --> 21:18.690
<b>You're right.</b>

21:19.360 --> 21:21.020
<b>Yeah, I'll show them.</b>

22:56.950 --> 23:01.960
<b>Subtitle translation by:
Megumi Hunter</b>
